Score Calculation Formula (lenient)

Score = (relevance × 0.20)
      + (technical_accuracy × 0.15)
      + (originality × 0.20)
      + (tone_quality × 0.20)
      + (engagement_potential × 0.25)

Verdict:
  → rejected if category = "spam" (banned)
  → rejected if technical_accuracy < 5
  → rejected if tone_quality < 10
  → rejected if score < 40 (threshold)
  → approved otherwise


